usage: colab_control_v001.py [-h] [--config CONFIG] [--token-file TOKEN_FILE]
                             {list,create,exec-file,upload,download,read,heartbeat}
                             ...

Small Colab controller with refreshed proxy tokens and sanitized output. Use
the existing .venv-colab interpreter. Credentials stay in the existing SDK
store. This module never initializes CLI logging or launches interactive auth.
All allocation/execution actions require an explicit subcommand.

positional arguments:
  {list,create,exec-file,upload,download,read,heartbeat}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG
  --token-file TOKEN_FILE
